;; Use case: canceling an objection.
;;
;; The author of a pending objection takes it back, mistaken or convinced. It stays
;; visible, canceled, awaits nothing and is never reacted to. Only the objection changes:
;; a publication that answers it keeps its answer, and publishing it leaves it canceled.
